Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.15,0:01:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是本田透
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年的情人节
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也做了一些准备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我买了一些小巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送给了这些照顾我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果红叶却说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白色情人节那天要以洗温泉来做为回礼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.81,0:01:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就在白色情人节当天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.77,0:01:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们展开了"信步温泉之旅"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.11,0:01:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 小透你看 是山
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 是山
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是河
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 是河
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.02,0:01:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是田
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 是田
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 好棒啊 今天是个大晴天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:01:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 由希、阿夹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩怎么都阴阳怪气的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夹、由希 谢谢你们俩今天陪我一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你们俩可能还有别的事情想去做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啦 就是没有才会来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你别瞎操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:29.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好久没洗温泉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.49,0:02:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能一起来我也很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.35,0:02:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由希和阿夹都很怕冷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以最喜欢温泉了 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就到旅馆了 我们一定要尽兴地玩喔 小透
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经高兴得无法自制了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到情人节的回礼能和大家一起去洗温泉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.07,0:02:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能搭这么奢侈的包租游览巴士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:03:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉上我就好像个公主一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你是公主 那我就是王子了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.42,0:03:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇～～
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 好像去洗温泉都会给人这种感觉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:14.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 快要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇～好棒的旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面更棒喔 小透公主
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 这种气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:30.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的感觉像个公主了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果小透你是公主 那我就是主上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我再来接各位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢…欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是老板"狼"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是老板娘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没…没事吧 你是不是身体不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:10.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老板"狼"也是草摩家人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她的身体不好 所以就住在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边管理旅馆一边养身体
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉吓到您了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您不要太勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.97,0:04:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的身体才是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 真是个好心的小姐 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望紫吴少爷也一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的工作是不是很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已不是"少爷"的年纪了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说有两部作品的截稿日期都到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的客人只有你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请慢慢地休息
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:50.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然知道老板娘也是草摩家的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她知道十二生肖的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.36,0:04:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道她也是十二生肖的一位？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好宽敞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:05.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮各位准备了最好的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.61,0:05:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 你过来 这个庭园好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:14.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇～ 好美 好感动喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部有多大呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.25,0:05:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边的森林和那座山全都是草摩家的地
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.23,0:05:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？全部都是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 全部都是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:32.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一定值得去走走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过也有人一去散步就再也没回来过喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:38.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 笑笑就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是开玩笑啊 就是嘛 怎么可能会有…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.98,0:05:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 小透
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人都被找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为草摩的搜查队个个都是专家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 还有搜查队啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 小透我说笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊..原来啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.23,0:06:01.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透小姐的房间就在少爷们的隔壁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道我要跟那臭由希住同一个房间？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还没有和好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 里面有纸门 可以帮你们隔开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题不在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这间旅…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:20.04,Default - TOP,NTP,0,0,0,,你少装了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:22.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实你是想跟小透一起睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真下流
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.75,0:06:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才没有这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红叶 你怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夹少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:35.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么可以有这种想法 你这样子想的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将来一定会发生事情的 到时你就后悔不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在是叫人害怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的样子才叫人害怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 是我不对 我向你们道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向全世界道歉 请原谅我 原谅我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 跟他同房就同房
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 淫荡淫荡…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的身体真的很虚弱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请各位慢慢休息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 终于安静了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:07.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离晚餐还有一点时间 我们去泡温泉吧 小透
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起泡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是最淫荡的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.07,0:07:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样了 红叶还小嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去洗 要去要去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以太任性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.76,0:07:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们今天来这里不是来为难小透的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是晚上要和我一起睡喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.51,0:08:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他根本不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒喔 我还是第一次泡露天温泉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红叶可以游泳了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在游泳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照片！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再跳一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.09,0:08:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红叶 拜托你安静点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.49,0:08:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 水温如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底想干嘛 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是小透一个人很无聊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 小透
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起来唱歌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:08:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就很像大家一起泡 一定会很快乐的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唱..唱歌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:02.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点唱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…我不知道要唱什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.95,0:09:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我来唱好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H408FBD&\4c&H9FE6E9&}夕阳西下的山上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H408FBD&\4c&H9FE6E9&}闪闪发光的红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:24.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H408FBD&\4c&H9FE6E9&}青蛙和蜥蜴在说着你好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H408FBD&\4c&H9FE6E9&}有鲤鱼…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:26.53,Default - TOP,NTP,0,0,0,,你在唱什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的歌 是我自己作的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:31.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道不能作首好听点的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 你也一起唱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H408FBD&\4c&H9FE6E9&}夕阳西下的山上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H408FBD&\4c&H9FE6E9&}闪闪发光的红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换你唱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(2000,3700,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H5D7498&\4c&HA0C0E9&}夕阳西下的山上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(2000,4000,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H5D7498&\4c&HA0C0E9&}闪闪发光的红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H408FBD&\4c&H9FE6E9&}青蛙和蜥蜴在说着你好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.73,0:09:57.39,Default - TOP,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是青蛙跟蜥蜴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:10:00.00,Default - TOP,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 别唱这首了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(6200,7500,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H5D7498&\4c&HA0C0E9&}青蛙和蜥蜴在说着你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:07.40,Default - TOP,NTP,0,0,0,,哇～ 我快发疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(3200,4500,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H5D7498&\4c&HA0C0E9&}夕阳西下的山上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.71,0:10:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(3000,4100,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H5D7498&\4c&HA0C0E9&}闪闪发光的红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(3100,4100,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H419190&\4c&H5B88C4&}青蛙和蜥蜴…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(3400,4200,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H419190&\4c&H5B88C4&}在说着你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(2500,3600,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H419190&\4c&H5B88C4&}有鲤鱼生鱼片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(4200,6500,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H419190&\4c&H5B88C4&}还有活的小鳗鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(2200,3500,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H419190&\4c&H5B88C4&}夕阳西下的山上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(4200,5800,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H419190&\4c&H5B88C4&}闪闪发光的红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.21,0:10:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\alpha&H00&\t(3100,4400,\alpha&HFF&)\fn方正隶变_GBK\bord4\blur4\shard2\3c&H419190&\4c&H5B88C4&}青蛙和蜥蜴在说着你好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醒啦 你刚才在温泉里昏倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的温泉很容易让人头晕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说这张照片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为塑胶袋包得很紧 所以没有弄湿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 我好像给你添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在是很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:42.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人怎么可以向我道歉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的温泉容易让人头晕 我才应该先跟你道歉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个不称职的老板娘 实在是太丢脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想挖个洞钻进去喔 对不起 实在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:04.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我母亲 她去年过世了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想让妈妈享受一下温泉 所以就…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真叫人感动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我已经没事了 真的很谢谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哇哇～ 好棒的大餐喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是山中的珍味
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多吃得完吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮各位盛饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 你今天是公主 这种事由我来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢…谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.28,0:12:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么多饭她哪吃得完…好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.25,0:12:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打我干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天小透最大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 快点吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 那我要开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可别客气喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办 因为太高兴反而觉得紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我要开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夹到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.87,0:13:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好…好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们也吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 多吃点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅坚持要跟少爷们打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少爷们 好久不见 不知道料理的味道如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:40.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是跟以前一样好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃到下巴都快掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下！失礼了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实…实在是很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天上给少爷们的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.97,0:14:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来是打算不是很烫就是要很凉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到我一时的疏忽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟端出这种不热不冷的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今 我一定要切腹谢罪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 都是我的责任 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.65,0:14:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的错…是我的错…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.39,0:14:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道他们俩是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 他们是堂兄妹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遗传的力量真可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:30.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,温泉的氤氲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:37.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 既然难得来了 就再去泡一次露天温泉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.75,0:14:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过要小心别再昏倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？容易头晕的人专用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是好贴心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 你不会冷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕会把你弄湿 所以请你在那边忍一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.31,0:15:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老板娘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.24,0:15:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道水温如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个板子是我刚才放上去的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又跟妈妈一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透小姐你真体贴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里 没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才我没有机会告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我儿子也跟少爷们一样是十二生肖的一员 他是猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚开始听到你的事时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说 我真的很担心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.98,0:15:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然有草摩以外的人知道十二生肖这个秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:50.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕我儿子和少爷们内心的创伤会更深
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 现在我为自己曾有这种想法跟你道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.36,0:16:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是小透小姐的话那我就安心了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.86,0:16:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将来有一天 如果你能遇到我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请像你和少爷们一样好好地跟他相处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想赶快见到你喔 小猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 老板娘是小津的妈妈 抱歉忘记告诉你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.45,0:16:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小津？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 小透你要不要打乒乓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们俩根本不理我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说过球只能弹一次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.67,0:16:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样怎么打下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是规则啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又出界？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夹 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想说偶而陪你玩玩也好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:16:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本不行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁跟你玩这个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拳头！男人就要靠拳头决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.33,0:17:10.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你自己说要比乒乓的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.40,0:17:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…这样好了 来跟我比吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很好玩 比吧比吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我话先说在前头 我可不会因为你是女生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就故意放水喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.71,0:17:23.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘记了 只能弹一次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 没打到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看就知道了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真笨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没资格说她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.53,0:17:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你就很厉害吗 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不信就来比啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁怕谁…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.08,0:18:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由希 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.55,0:18:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是哪里不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.55,0:18:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的…好好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会突然挥空呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以当面笑我的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要在阿夹的面前笑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说我连在父母面前也不曾这么笑过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑得好开心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.61,0:18:33.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.92,0:18:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该早点给你的 可是一直找不到时机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我送你的回礼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.37,0:18:54.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来一直下不定决心要送你什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来想说这可能最适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗？公主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…是 当然喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.62,0:19:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.99,0:19:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.30,0:19:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是光荣之至
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.61,0:19:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.41,0:19:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样子真的好像王子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草摩家有好多的王子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.49,0:19:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很帅的 很可爱的 很体贴的王子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能这样子渡过一生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:20:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我真的是好高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.77,0:20:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么美好的夜晚我一定要说出我的谢意才行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在是舍不得你们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们一定要再来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.69,0:20:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也别紧靠着我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您保重身体
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透也是 好好保重
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你好重
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.57,0:20:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接我们的巴士怎么那么慢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和红叶又要很久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 春天开始你要念几年级呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:47.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初中一年级吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:48.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.55,0:20:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春天开始我就是高中一年级
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.92,0:20:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我要念你们学校和阿春一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:20:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？你和阿春干嘛偷偷来报考我们学校
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.33,0:21:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了让你们吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本田 我想你可能不太清楚 其实红叶只小我们一岁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和阿春同年
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直以为他是小学生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到今年春天就要在同一个学校念书
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是跟阿春一起…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在是不知叫我该惊讶哪个了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:26.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都惊讶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今年春天以后的高中生涯一定会很热闹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.10,0:21:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给小透
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.17,0:21:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我送给你的情人节回礼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.31,0:21:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想到她会穿着这个叫我"主人"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就觉得好兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.21,0:21:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要被抓去关就好了
